## Data and Research Disclaimer

The dataset included in this project is synthetic and was created for
educational, analytical, and demonstration purposes. It does not represent
real patient records, actual hospital admissions, or confidential health
information.

The forecasts, statistical analyses, machine learning models, visualizations,
and findings generated by this project are intended for research,
demonstration, and educational purposes only. They should not be interpreted
as medical advice, clinical guidance, epidemiological surveillance, or a
substitute for validated healthcare decision-support systems.

Users who adapt this project for real-world public-health or healthcare
applications are responsible for independently validating the data, models,
assumptions, performance, and regulatory requirements before deployment.

Third-party libraries, datasets, references, and other external materials
used by or referenced in this project remain subject to their respective
licenses and terms of use.

